Chris branch summary

- Added Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite support to BioDiscoveryAgent.
- Added retry/backoff handling for Gemini 429/503 errors.
- Updated fallback/helper calls to use the active model instead of hard-coded Claude.
- Reproduced the IFNG baseline with Gemini across 3 runs (128 genes × 5 rounds).
- Added feedback ablation modes: full, hits-only, and no-feedback.
- Completed and saved hits-only runs 1 and 2; run 3 was interrupted by Gemini quota limits.
- Saved baseline and feedback experiment logs/results for reproducibility.
